%% Student can run only an active, assigned Agent/config; assignment creator must be Admin.
%% Admin alone authors/publishes Agent configs and ingests KB files.
%% AGENT_EXECUTION.sessionId is optional: null for Admin Agent preview/test;
%% real Student chat execution has a matching owner-scoped AgentSession.
%% Standalone Admin KB Studio Test is independent of Student chat and need not
%% be represented as AgentExecution when no AgentConfiguration exists.
%% Admin preview is an AgentExecution with executionMode=ADMIN_PREVIEW before config publish.
%% Admin KB Test is distinct from a Student AgentSession and uses scoped source evidence.
%% AgentExecution stores actual model-invoked tool calls: 3 approved read-only domain tools.
%% Stored structured reports require explicit request, schema-validated output, owner-only access.
%% Plans are persisted only after Student confirms, not when the Agent suggests a plan.
%% AgentSession.contextSummary can contain bounded same-owner prior-session context;
%% summarySourceRefs records all originating session IDs / interaction IDs (transitive lineage).
%% summaryStatus: NONE | VALID | INVALIDATED. Use a summary only when VALID and source refs
%% remain authorized, undeleted and owned by the same user. On deleting any referenced
%% interaction/session, invalidate every dependent summary (including in OTHER sessions);
%% it must not be reused until recomputed solely from remaining permitted sources.
%% Retention of backups / audit is OPEN. No fixed 30/90-day expiration.
%% Core remains usable without any external LLM. ModelAnswer access controls apply to tools/RAG.

%% v1.2 compatibility rules (READ-ONLY target model):
%% Session.configurationId is pinned on first Student chat creation. A later Agent publish
%% never silently changes the version used by that existing session.
%% ADMIN_PREVIEW: execution has inputSnapshot and configurationId, but no session or
%% inputInteractionId. KB_TEST: execution has knowledgeBaseId and inputSnapshot,
%% may have NO AgentConfiguration/session/interaction; logs evidence and latency.
%% STUDENT_CHAT: execution has a pinned session/config and authorized interaction.
%% ADMIN_PREVIEW and KB_TEST both persist executionMode, initiatedByUserId,
%% toolStepsAndSources, outputSnapshot, status, timing, tokens and cost WHEN available;
%% token/cost may be null if KB Test is retrieval-only (do not invent model usage).
%% KnowledgeBase.scopeType PLATFORM or ENTERPRISE; enterpriseId required iff ENTERPRISE.
%% MVP Admin KB Studio uses PLATFORM only; enterprise scope is future-capable, access
%% is NEVER granted implicitly by enterpriseId or visibility.
